Third-party data and content
================================================================================

This application includes a snapshot of hazard data (`public/data/hips.json`)
fetched from the PreventionWeb API
(https://www.preventionweb.net/api/terms/hips) and rendered in the UI. That
data is drawn from the UNDRR-ISC Hazard Information Profiles (HIPs), which
are the copyrighted work of their respective authors and are NOT covered by
the Apache License above.

